    "FAQsTitle": "System Guide & FAQs",
    "FAQsSubtitle": "Everything you need to know about Aqooni Digital.",
    "FAQ1_Question": "What is the Aqooni Digital Ecosystem?",
    "FAQ1_Answer": "Aqooni Digital is a next-generation institutional management platform that centralizes academic records, real-time attendance tracking, and secure digital certification into a single, cohesive cloud ecosystem.",
    "FAQ2_Question": "How do you ensure data sovereignty and security?",
    "FAQ2_Answer": "We prioritize your institution's digital sovereignty. All data is protected by enterprise-grade AES-256 encryption and hosted on high-availability secure cloud clusters with automated daily backups.",
    "FAQ3_Question": "Can I manage multiple school branches simultaneously?",
    "FAQ3_Answer": "Absolutely. Our 'Multi-School Gateway' allows super administrators to monitor and manage multiple independent campuses or branches from a single unified dashboard without data cross-contamination.",
    "FAQ4_Question": "How does the certificate verification system work?",
    "FAQ4_Answer": "Every certificate generated by Aqooni is assigned a unique cryptographic ID. Stakeholders can enter this ID into our public verification portal to instantly view the authentic, tamper-proof academic record.",
    "FAQ5_Question": "Is the platform mobile-responsive for parents?",
    "FAQ5_Answer": "Yes, Aqooni is built as a Progressive Web App (PWA), ensuring that parents can access attendance history and academic records on any device with a native-app-like experience.",
    "FAQ6_Question": "Does it support local languages in the region?",
    "FAQ6_Answer": "Yes, our system is deeply localized, offering full native support for English, Arabic, and Somali to ensure accessibility for all users across the region.",
    "ContactTitle": "Get In Touch",
    "ContactSubtitle": "Our expert team is here to help your institution succeed.",
